@page "/privacy"
@layout MainLayout

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy - MyTransportApp</PageTitle>

<div class="privacy-container" style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <header class="mb-4">
        <h1 class="section-title" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="section-subtitle" style="margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-dim);">
            <strong>Effective Date:</strong> October 16, 2026
        </p>
    </header>

    <div class="card p-4 p-md-5" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.7;">
        <p>
            <strong>MyTransportProject</strong> ("we", "our", or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and share your information when you use our application.
        </p>

        <section>
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>When you sign in or interact with MyTransportProject using your Google Account, we collect:</p>
            <ul style="padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0;">
                <li><strong>Basic Profile Information:</strong> Your name, email address, and profile picture URL provided via Google OAuth.</li>
                <li><strong>Application Data:</strong> Transport preferences, routes, or usage logs generated while using the application.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-2">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>We use the collected information exclusively to:</p>
            <ul style="padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0;">
                <li>Authenticate your identity and manage your user session.</li>
                <li>Provide, operate, and maintain the core features of MyTransportProject.</li>
                <li>Respond to support inquiries and troubleshoot technical issues.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-2">3. Data Storage and Security</h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">
                Your data is stored on encrypted databases and transmitted solely over secure HTTPS connections. We retain your personal information only for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide you services.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-2">4. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">
                We <strong>do not</strong> sell, rent, or trade your Google user data or personal information to third parties, advertisers, or data brokers. Data is only shared with infrastructure providers strictly necessary to host and run the application.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-2">5. Google API Services User Data Policy Compliance</h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">
                MyTransportProject's use and transfer to any other app of information received from Google APIs will adhere to the <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>, including the Limited Use requirements.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-2">6. Data Deletion and User Rights</h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">
                You may revoke MyTransportProject's access to your Google account at any time via your <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Account Security Settings</a>. To request permanent deletion of your account and associated data, contact us at the email below.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-2">7. Contact Us</h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">
                If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at: <a href="mailto:98heniuschen@gmail.com">98heniuschen@gmail.com</a>
            </p>
        </section>

        <div class="pt-3 border-top" style="border-color: var(--border-color) !important;">
            <a href="" class="btn btn--primary" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; text-decoration: none;">
                <span aria-hidden="true">🏠</span> Return to Home
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
